  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social protection floors extended and progressively raised</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This CPO will contribute to enhancement of Uzbekistan&#x2019;s social protection system, building on recent reforms and the National Social Protection Strategy 2022-2030. ILO will provide technical assistance to the newly created National Agency for Social Protection (NASP) and other relevant stakeholders in extending social protection coverage via the implementation of new social insurance law. In particular, the ILO will support the development of an unemployment insurance system and promoting corporate social responsibility to ensure compliance with social protection mechanisms at the enterprise level.</narrative>
  </description>
